<title>HONG KONG: HK March property deals down 12 pct/value on month.</title>
<headline>HK March property deals down 12 pct/value on month.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong recorded 16,124 sale and purchase agreements worth HK$64.9 billion in March for building units including residential and non-residential properties, the government Land Registry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The value of the agreements fell 11.7 percent compared to February 1997 but rose 73.5 percent from March last yar.</p>
<p>The number of deals fell five percent from February but rose 35.3 percent from March 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
